      "writtenOn": "2025-03-18T12:05:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m mirroring [this key](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:art/runtime/oat/oat.h;l\u003d60;drc\u003dd7acd7d5623f67aa959ae23a362c337288e96d69) in the OAT header, which is exactly what the SDC file is overriding. If we\u0027d like to change the name, we need to change the OAT header as well. Two difference names for the same thing can only add more confusion.\n\nHowever, I\u0027m only adding helper classes for the SDC file in this CL, so changing the name is out of scope.",
