      "message": "I\u0027m basically following [what dex2oat does](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:art/dex2oat/dex2oat.cc;l\u003d1689-1694;drc\u003d4370b86853f0fdf16f0e957365c6b600e5b32fe2) when preparing the OAT header. It doesn\u0027t looks like dex2oat is vetting the value. AFAIK, this value can even be an empty string, in testing environments, so there isn\u0027t much we can verify here.",
