      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks. Added them.\n\n\u003e If #1 is correct then we should ensure that a newly written SDM file cannot pick up an older garbage SDC file.\n\nGood point! I actually missed it! I added a timestamp of the SDM file for this.",
      "parentUuid": "ddaad1a5_07d607b0",
      "revId": "ac0c568e04389babe94db101353cf829b617bf69",
